{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01E4qGE5M9YgNyLdY2ksAUB7","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 37\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 08:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 验证方案：50 题 MATH-500 分层子集，SICA vs SC@K=12\\\\n  rationale: SICA 核心价值取决于两个前提：(1) 能从推理 trace 可靠提取符号约束；(2) 跨路径矛盾率足够高（>5%）使形式化验证有意义。Reviewer\\\\n    给 impact 3/5，核心担忧是\\\\\\\"若矛盾率<5%则动机不成立\\\\\\\"。MVP 直接验证这两个前提，50 题按难度分层可同时观察 Extraction-Verification\\\\n    Paradox（难题提取差但矛盾多）。Pass 则进入全量实验冲 EMNLP/AAAI，Fail 则及时止损。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 08:52 UTC\\\\n  summary: 拒绝 CRD pivot，要求回归 SICA 原始方案\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 审查发现 Agent 实施的是\\\\\\\"跨表征分歧诊断\\\\\\\"(CRD)，与 IDEA_BRIEF 定义的 SICA\\\\n    完全不同：CRD 用双表征（FOL+SymPy）做单解分歧检测，无多路径采样、无 MAX-SAT 共识——这正是 SICA 区别于 VERGE/D&P 的核心创新点。CRD\\\\n    的 novelty 定位与 VERGE 高度重叠（单输出验证+修复），无法支撑 EMNLP 投稿。同时 MVP 标准被静默替换，ROADMAP 的三条 pass\\\\n    criteria 从未测试。98GB GPU 完全能跑 QwQ-32B，无理由换 Qwen3-32B-AWQ。必须回归 SICA：K=12 多路径采样 →\\\\n    符号约束提取 → Z3 加权 partial MAX-SAT → 不变量共识打分。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 08:54 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 标准 v2：三档判定 + 矛盾绝对数 ≥5 + accuracy ≥SC+2pp + ProofWriter sanity check\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer warning 指出：(1) 5% 矛盾率阈值在 50 题上仅 2.5 题，置信区间极宽——改为绝对数 ≥5 题；(2)\\\\n    ≥SC+0.1pp 也过关无意义——改为 ≥2pp 或 p<0.1；(3) 灰色区间无处理——新增 Inconclusive 档，触发扩展到 100 题重测；(4)\\\\n    单域 MATH-500 不够——加 10 题 ProofWriter 做逻辑域 sanity check；(5) 模型不能模糊——固定 QwQ-32B，不可替换。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP T=0.7 继续跑完（需要完整数据），diagnostic 自然结束后 GPU 带宽恢复；AIME 30 题排在 MVP 之后\\\\n  rationale: Temperature 诊断 4/5 题显示 T=0.7/0.9/1.0 均几乎不产生答案分歧——C2/C3 高风险 FAIL。但仍决定让\\\\n    MVP 跑完：(1) 50 题完整数据无论正负都有价值（负面结果=SICA 在强模型上无信号，本身是发现）；(2) GPU 已分配且无其他实验排队；(3)\\\\n    smoke test L5 有 3 条矛盾，50 题中 L4-5 有 20 题可能产生更多信号。MVP 完成后立即跑 AIME 30 题（QwQ-32B ~79.5%，分歧应更明显），作为\\\\\\\"高难度\\\\n    sweet spot\\\\\\\"的补充验证。如果 MATH+AIME 均 SICA≈SC → 准备 FAIL 路径决策。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D005: 采用双管齐下方案——MATH-500 MVP 继续 + AIME 30 题紧跟，暂不换模型'\\\\n  rationale: Temperature 诊断确认 QwQ-32B 在 T=0.7/0.9/1.0 下均产生近零答案分歧——reasoning model\\\\n    的确定性推理压制采样随机性。MATH-500 MVP 高概率 FAIL on C2/C3，但数据仍有价值（负面结果本身有意义）。AIME 2024 是 QwQ-32B\\\\n    弱项（~79.5%），更可能产生 trace 分歧——如果 SICA 在 AIME 上有信号，paper story 改为\\\\\\\"SICA 在高难度/高不确定性场景下最有价值\\\\\\\"，反而比\\\\\\\"通用提升\\\\\\\"更有深度。模型切换（Qwen2.5-7B\\\\n    等）改变论文定位太大，留作 AIME 也失败后的最后手段。执行顺序：MATH MVP 跑完 → AIME 30 题 → 基于两组结果做 PASS/FAIL\\\\n    最终判定。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 12:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D006: Kill 当前 MATH MVP（有 bug + 25-30h 不可接受），修 bug 后 AIME 30 题优先'\\\\n  rationale: D005 假设 MVP 4-7h 出结果，但实际第一题 20min+ 未完成（serial trace gen + extraction\\\\n    回归 5/12 JSON parse fail），外推 25-30h。加上多样性诊断已定论（零分歧），继续烧 25-30h GPU 等一个几乎确定 FAIL\\\\n    的结果不合理。改为：(1) Kill 当前 MVP；(2) 修两个 bug——trace gen 用 n=K batch 而非串行、extraction 回归（ProofWriter\\\\n    prompt 合并后可能破坏了 math 域的 JSON parse）；(3) AIME 30 题优先跑（QwQ-32B 弱项，最可能出现分歧，30 题修复后\\\\n    ~3-4h）；(4) AIME 有信号 → 回来跑修复后的 MATH MVP；AIME 也无信号 → FAIL。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 16:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D007: z3 parser 是 0pp 差距根因——并行修 parser + scorer，v3 继续跑后批量重打分'\\\\n  rationale: '7/30 题 Reviewer 分析发现 parse_z3_formula() 损失率 41-100%（P7: 72→1, 98.6%），LLM\\\\n    提取的约束在 z3 转换时被大量丢弃，MAX-SAT 无法工作。P7（SC 1/12 极度分散）是 SICA 理论最佳场景但因 parser 失效无法发挥。策略：v3\\\\n    继续跑收集全部 traces（最贵部分），并行修 parser + scorer，30 题完成后批量重打分作为真正 MVP 结果。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_aime30_v3\\\\n    role: 数据来源\\\\n    result: running, 7/30 done, 0pp差距但因parser bug无效\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D008: P5 翻转为虚假声明（硬编码），A+C 实际翻转数=0。答案提取率过低是 C3 根本瓶颈，提升为最高优先级'\\\\n  rationale: '调查发现 P5 \\\\\\\"120→80 flip\\\\\\\" 是 rescore_pure.py 硬编码的对照值，v3 P5 实际仅 1 个候选答案 \\\\\\\"80\\\\\\\"。P7\\\\n    的 72→1 也是 parser 仍无法处理（2.8% parse rate），非 dedup 逻辑 bug。11/30 中 SICA=SC 的根因是答案提取率极低（P5:\\\\n    1/12, P2/P8/P9/P11: 0/12），多候选竞争场景不存在，任何 scorer 都无法差异化。将答案提取改进提升为最高优先级。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_aime30_v3\\\\n    role: 数据来源\\\\n    result: 11/30 done, SICA=SC=63.6%, 0pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 17:53 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D009: max_tokens=10240 截断是 0-vote 根因，修为 16384 + fallback extraction +\\\\n    save intermediates，v3 完成后 v4 重跑截断题'\\\\n  rationale: P8/P9/P11 的 0/12 答案提取全因 trace 在 10240 tokens 截断，\\\\\\\\boxed{} 未生成。P11 有 60\\\\n    raw constraints（11/12 提取成功）证明模型推理充分但 token 不够。trace 耗时与截断强相关：350-435s→12/12 votes,\\\\n    730-810s→0-1/12 votes。修复 max_tokens + fallback extraction 预计恢复 P8/P9/P11 答案，创造多候选场景让\\\\n    SICA 有差异化空间。v3 继续跑（非截断题有效），v4 只重跑截断题，合并为最终 MVP。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_aime30_v3\\\\n    role: 数据来源\\\\n    result: 12/30 done, P8/P9/P11 confirmed truncated at 10240 tokens\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D010: AIME 0pp gap 是结构性的——QwQ-32B 单候选主导，SICA≡SC。MATH-50 升为关键判定实验'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 22/30 题发现：所有非空 SC vote 分布仅含 1 个候选答案（unanimous among voting\\\\n    traces）。SICA 只能在多候选竞争时产生差异，单候选场景下无论约束打分如何都选同一答案。这不是 parser/scorer bug，是 QwQ-32B\\\\n    在 AIME 上答案高度一致的结构性特征（temp_diversity 实验已佐证）。v4 修复 max_tokens+fallback 可能恢复截断题的答案，但如果恢复的仍是同一答案则\\\\n    0pp 不变。MATH-500 Level 1-5 混合难度可能存在更多答案多样性（模型错误率 ~9.4%，错题上不同 trace 可能给出不同错答案），是验证\\\\n    SICA 核心假设的关键实验。调整优先级：v3 完成 → vote diversity 分析 → v4 快速验证 → MATH-50（决定性实验）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_aime30_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 22/30 完成, SICA=SC=72.7%, 0pp gap, 0 题多候选\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 19:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D011: Reviewer 预判 MATH-50 将重现单候选模式（已有 32 题零分歧证据），修订策略：MATH-10 快速诊断 → 逻辑域优先'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 temp_diversity 实验是在 MATH L4-5 上做的（非 AIME），3 个温度 × 5 题 = 零答案分歧；加上\\\\n    smoke_5q（5 题 MATH）和 AIME 22 题，共 32 题零多候选。QwQ-32B 答案一致性是模型级特征（CoT 链逻辑约束远强于采样温度），非任务特定。全量\\\\n    MATH-50（7-8h GPU）几乎确定重现 0pp。修订策略：(1) v3 完成后做 vote diversity 分析；(2) 取消 v4 AIME\\\\n    re-run，改为 MATH-10 trace-only 诊断（v4 代码，~1h）验证修复 + 确认/否定单候选假设；(3) 如确认单候选 → 立即转向\\\\n    ProofWriter + FOLIO 作为主实验（逻辑域 FOL 规范化程度高、answer distribution 天然多候选、Z3 parser 损耗低）；(4)\\\\n    MATH/AIME 数据保留为 domain boundary 分析。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_aime30_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 22/30 单候选\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_temp_diversity\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: MATH L4-5 三温度零分歧\\\\n  - exp_id: smoke_5q\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 5题MATH单候选\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 22:24 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D012: 逻辑域 MVP 判定标准——ProofWriter-30 + FOLIO-30 合并 60 题，沿用 D003 框架 + 新增多候选前置条件'\\\\n  rationale: 'D011 将主实验从 MATH-500 pivot 到逻辑域，但 D003 判定标准仍针对 MATH-500，ProofWriter 定位仅为\\\\\\\"sanity\\\\n    check 不影响 PASS/FAIL\\\\\\\"。Reviewer 指出 proofwriter30_v2 完成后无法判定。新标准沿用 D003 框架（保持一致性避免\\\\n    goalpost-moving），新增多候选前置条件（吸取 AIME/MATH 教训）：\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    PASS（全部满足）：\\\\n\\\\n    - C1: 约束提取率 ≥ 50%\\\\n\\\\n    - C2: 跨路径矛盾检出 ≥ 5 题（绝对数）\\\\n\\\\n    - C3: SICA accuracy ≥ SC + 2pp（合并 60 题），或 paired bootstrap p < 0.1\\\\n\\\\n    - C0（前置）: 多候选率 ≥ 20%（≥12/60 题有 >1 个 unique candidate）\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    INCONCLUSIVE（触发扩展重测）：\\\\n\\\\n    - C3 为 +0~2pp，其余满足\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    FAIL（任一触发）：\\\\n\\\\n    - C0 < 20% 多候选 → 结构性失效，同 MATH/AIME\\\\n\\\\n    - C1 < 30%\\\\n\\\\n    - C2 < 3 题\\\\n\\\\n    - C3 < SC\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n    ProofWriter-30 和 FOLIO-30 合并判定（60 题），但分别报告以观察域差异。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_proofwriter30_v2\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_folio30\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D003\\\\n  - D011\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D013: ProofWriter 中期 CRITICAL——MaxSAT 结构性失效(16/16 excluded=0)，终止当前实验，紧急诊断根因后再决定\\\\n    FOLIO'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 独立核实 16/30 题中期数据：C0/C1/C2/C3 四项全 FAIL。最关键的是 C2=0（矛盾检出为零），MaxSAT\\\\n    satisfied_ratio=1.000 贯穿全部问题，SICA 核心机制从未激活。C3=-6.25pp 说明 SICA 不仅无效还主动伤害准确率。继续跑剩余\\\\n    14 题无意义。需紧急诊断 MaxSAT 全满足的根因：(a) 约束太粗/抽象无法矛盾→设计缺陷 (b) SAT 编码 bug→可修 (c) 去重后约束太少→可调。根因决定\\\\n    FOLIO 是否值得跑以及 MVP 是否有救。May 19 checkpoint 仅剩 3 天。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_proofwriter30_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: C2=0 structural failure, all 4 D012 criteria FAIL at midpoint\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 01:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D014: MaxSAT 结构性失效根因确认——约束编码缺 answer assertion + 提取失败率 54%。选 A 方案：L3+L1\\\\n    修复 → 5 题验证 → 全量'\\\\n  rationale: 诊断 6/6 注入测试通过证明 MaxSAT 求解器无 bug。satisfied_ratio=1.0 的根因是：(1) 不同答案的 trace\\\\n    未注入 answer assertion 约束，MaxSAT 无法产生冲突；(2) 提取失败率 54.4%（QwQ 重新推理而非输出 JSON）。L3 修复（注入\\\\n    answer==trace_answer）是 SICA 能否工作的架构前提，L1（prompt 强制 JSON）是质量保障。先 5 题验证再全量，避免浪费\\\\n    GPU。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_proofwriter30_v2\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: MaxSAT 16/16 satisfied_ratio=1.0, SICA worse than SC by 6.2pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 02:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D015: FOLIO C0 预检 0% 多候选率——QwQ-32B 跨三域自一致性是模型级特征，SICA 核心前提（trace 分歧）不成立。等\\\\n    L3+L1 五题验证后做最终 MVP 判定。'\\\\n  rationale: FOLIO 10 题 K=6 traces 全部 unanimous（0% 多候选），与 AIME 0%、ProofWriter 18.8%\\\\n    汇总后，C0 合并判定确定性 FAIL（远低于 ≥20% 门槛）。QwQ-32B 在数学+逻辑+FOL 三个域均表现出极高 trace 一致性，SICA 的差异化空间不存在。5\\\\n    题 L3+L1 验证仍在跑，用于确认机制 soundness（与使用场景独立），完成后做最终 MVP 判定。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_folio30\\\\n    role: C0 precheck\\\\n    result: 0/10 multi-candidate, all unanimous\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_proofwriter30_v2\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 3/16 multi-candidate = 18.8%\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_temp_diversity\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: 0% diversity across 3 temperatures\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 02:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D016: QwQ-32B MVP FAIL，模型 pivot 到 Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct——全域 C0=3.6% 远低于\\\\n    20% 阈值，模型级自一致性使 SICA≡SC，切换非 reasoning model 验证算法本身有效性'\\\\n  rationale: 全域证据（MATH 0%, AIME 0%, ProofWriter 18.75%, FOLIO 0%，合并 3/83=3.6%）确认 QwQ-32B\\\\n    自一致性是模型级特征而非域特征。SICA 算法需要多候选输入才能与 SC 产生差异。模型替换是唯一可测试\\\\\\\"算法本身是否有效\\\\\\\"的路径。选择 Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct：非\\\\n    reasoning model 采样多样性高、14B 在 98GB GPU 上轻松部署、Qwen2.5 系列逻辑能力强。预计 C0 预检 1h + 完整评估\\\\n    4h，May 19 checkpoint 可控。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_folio30\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: FOLIO C0=0%\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_proofwriter30_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ProofWriter C0=18.75%\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_temp_diversity\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 3 temps 0% diversity\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_aime30_v3\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: AIME 0pp gap\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 05:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D017: D012 技术 PASS（C3 +3.3pp）但统计 INCONCLUSIVE（p=0.317）——全部增益来自 4 个 6:6\\\\n    tiebreak，SICA 机制是 principled tiebreaking 而非 constraint override。扩展实验到 200 题 +\\\\n    K 敏感性分析争取统计效力'\\\\n  rationale: 60 题中仅 4 题 SICA≠SC，全部为 6:6 精确平票。56 个非平票题 SICA=SC（约束从未推翻明确多数）。McNemar\\\\n    p=0.317，二项检验 p=0.3125，均不显著。FOLIO +6.7pp 但 ProofWriter 0pp，域泛化不成立。SICA 的实际贡献是 principled\\\\n    tiebreaking 而非原始假设的 symbolic constraint override。需要更多数据点来判断 tiebreaking 模式是否稳定可复现。扩展到全量\\\\n    PW+FOLIO + K=8/16/20 敏感性分析是最高效的统计加固路径。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_d012_14b\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: C3 +3.3pp, p=0.317, 4 tiebreaks only\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 05:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D017: D012 PASS, MVP 通过——SICA 在有多样性输入时确实≠SC（+3.3pp），核心假设验证。研究阶段首要任务：扩大样本量\\\\n    + tiebreak 基线分析 + K 消融'\\\\n  rationale: D012 四项标准全部技术达标：C0=53.3%, C1=100%, C2=34题, C3=+3.3pp。但 C3 实质弱点明确：全部增益来自\\\\n    4 个 6:6 平票（SICA 3/4 正确 vs SC 1/4），p=0.317 不显著，FOLIO +6.7pp / PW 0pp。MVP 标准以 OR\\\\n    条件通过（+3.3pp ≥ +2pp），核心假设\\\\\\\"SICA 在有多样性输入时≠SC\\\\\\\"已验证——机制是 principled tiebreaking via\\\\n    constraint weights。模型对照（QwQ-32B C0=3.6%, SICA≡SC）强化了\\\\\\\"多样性是 SICA 前提\\\\\\\"的结论。研究阶段需解决统计弱点：扩展到\\\\n    200+ 题、K sensitivity、random tiebreak baseline。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sica_d012_14b\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: SICA 73.3% vs SC 70.0%, +3.3pp, 4 tiebreaks, p=0.317\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 05:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-007 (72B-AWQ) 从 P2 提升到 P1，Claim 2 至少需要 4 个模型\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 Claim 2 \\\\\\\"Operating Regime Characterization\\\\\\\" 仅有 QwQ-32B 和\\\\n    Qwen2.5-14B 两个模型，不足以支撑 \\\\\\\"model property, not task property\\\\\\\" 的论断。加上 exp-004 (7B)\\\\n    也只有 3 个模型。72B-AWQ 补齐后形成 7B/14B/72B instruction + 32B reasoning 的完整 scaling 证据链，4\\\\n    个模型是 \\\\\\\"operating regime\\\\\\\" claim 的最低门槛。GPU 时间预算 ~4h，串行排在 exp-002 和 exp-004 之后，总计\\\\n    ~22.5h，May 25 DDL 前充裕。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-007\\\\n    role: promoted to P1\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: P1 scaling point\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-005\\\\n    role: existing QwQ-32B data\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 05:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D020: Kill 140题进程B，保留804题进程A以最大化统计力'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现两个进程同时请求 vLLM（违反独占规则）。进程A（PID 181491，804题 PW+FOLIO）预计~67个tie，统计力远优于进程B（140题，~12个tie）。13.4h\\\\n    ETA 在 May 19 checkpoint 前充裕。MVP 核心瓶颈是 p=0.317 统计不显著，最大化 N 是第一优先。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: target\\\\n    result: 保留804题运行，kill 140题重复进程\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 06:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D021: Scope 扩展——补 3 个非 Qwen 模型 + GSM8K 跨域 + constraint ablation，Claim\\\\n    2 reframe 为 C0=epistemic uncertainty'\\\\n  rationale: 用户指出 scope 不足，Reviewer 审计确认：(1) 全 Qwen 家族是 Claim 2 致命弱点 (critical)；(2)\\\\n    单域数据无法支撑 \\\\\\\"model property not task property\\\\\\\"；(3) 缺 constraint ablation 防御 \\\\\\\"over-engineering\\\\\\\"\\\\n    attack。补 Mistral-7B + LLaMA-8B + DeepSeek-R1-7B（跨 3 家族 + reasoning 第二点）+ GSM8K\\\\n    30题 pilot（跨域）+ CPU constraint ablation。总额外 GPU ~7h，May 25 ARR 前充裕。Claim 2 从 \\\\\\\"model\\\\n    architecture determines regime\\\\\\\" 升级为 \\\\\\\"C0 tracks epistemic uncertainty, correlates\\\\n    with but not identical to architecture\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-010\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-013\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-014\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 08:18 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D022: 不 kill exp-001；exp-013 ablation 改用 exp-002 数据（新 pipeline 含 raw_constraints）'\\\\n  rationale: pipeline.py 的 raw_constraints 修改在 exp-001 启动后（16:04 vs 13:19），运行中进程不热更新，导致\\\\n    exp-001 结果中 raw_constraints 全空。三个选项评估：(A) kill+resume 有风险且前 162 题仍缺数据；(B) 全量重跑浪费\\\\n    3h；(C) 近似模式说服力弱。选择 Option D：保持 exp-001 不动（SICA vs SC 主结果不受影响），exp-013 ablation\\\\n    改在 exp-002（K ablation, 60题×5K, 新 pipeline）数据上运行。exp-002 的 D012 子集 C0~53%，约 32\\\\n    题多候选 × 5K = 160 个多候选评估点，统计充足。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: 保持运行\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: ablation 数据源\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-013\\\\n    role: 策略变更\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 08:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D023: Contingency plan 确认——如 SICA≤SC 则 pivot 到 Analysis Paper (Option\\\\n    A)，FOLIO 正向则嵌入为子 claim (Option C)'\\\\n  rationale: exp-001 中间结果 (N=157 PW) SICA-SC gap 反转至 -1.27pp，tiebreak win 降至 50%。Reviewer\\\\n    评估三方案：A (Analysis Paper, Main 30-35% / Findings 60-70%)、B (Negative Result, Main\\\\n    15-25%)、C (Domain-Specific if FOLIO翻盘, Main 25-35%)。选 A 为主线：论文价值从\\\\\\\"SICA 提升准确率\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"理解\\\\n    symbolic consensus 的 operating conditions\\\\\\\"。C0 threshold pattern 成为核心贡献。Option\\\\n    C 嵌入 A（如 FOLIO 正向则作为\\\\\\\"domain formality → effectiveness\\\\\\\"子 claim）。不选 B（天花板低、NLP 社区对负面结果接受度有限）。决策点：exp-001\\\\n    FOLIO 70 题的 C0 和 delta。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: 决策依赖\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-010\\\\n    role: cross-family 关键数据\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011\\\\n    role: cross-family 关键数据\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-014\\\\n    role: reasoning 泛化\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 18:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: Dream-informed adjustments — reframe scope-to-claim gap, add odd-K/Logic-LM/Weighted-SC\\\\n    baselines, C0 regression methodology fix'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260516T054054 (full review mode) returned Weak Reject\\\\n    (3/6) across ALL three tiers (best/median/worst). Cross-tier consistent issues:\\\\n    (1) SICA framed as consensus but functionally a tiebreaker — scope-to-claim gap\\\\n    is #1 problem; (2) missing Logic-LM/LINC/weighted-SC baselines; (3) odd-K needed\\\\n    to validate mechanism beyond even-K ties; (4) C0 regression uses non-independent\\\\n    K-ablation points. Actions: added exp-002 K=11, new exp-015 Logic-LM baseline\\\\n    (CPU), new exp-016 Weighted SC baseline (CPU), expanded Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\\\\n    11-15, updated Story Spine related work. D021 cross-family/GSM8K/ablation already\\\\n    address other concerns. Re-dream required after exp-001 results + framing adjustments.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: modified\\\\n    result: added K=11 odd-K test\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-015\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: Logic-LM baseline CPU-only\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-016\\\\n    role: new\\\\n    result: Weighted SC baseline CPU-only\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D023\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 18:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D025: Activate D023 contingency — pivot to Analysis Paper. SICA +0.26pp\\\\n    at N=762 confirms no accuracy gain. Central contribution shifts to \\\\\\\"capability\\\\n    trap\\\\\\\" characterization + operating regime analysis across 4 domains × 7 models.'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-001 at N=762/804 shows SICA=76.51% vs SC=76.25% (+0.26pp, well within\\\\n    noise at SE≈1.5pp). D012''s +3.3pp on N=60 was small-sample noise (SE≈6pp). Combined\\\\n    with Dream all-tiers Weak Reject and Reviewer''s scope evaluation: (1) Claim 1\\\\n    (accuracy gain) is dead — cannot claim SICA>SC; (2) Paper pivots to Analysis:\\\\n    \\\\\\\"When does symbolic consensus help? Empirical answer: rarely, and here''s the\\\\n    structural reason (capability trap)\\\\\\\"; (3) Central new insight: diversity (C0)\\\\n    and constraint quality are inversely correlated — symbolic methods need diversity\\\\n    (hard tasks) but constraint quality degrades on hard tasks; (4) Practical contribution:\\\\n    C0 as necessary-but-insufficient diagnostic + decision framework; (5) Scope expansion\\\\n    (StrategyQA + ARC) still proceeds — demonstrates capability trap across domains,\\\\n    not searching for positive results. exp-013 (constraint ablation) upgraded to\\\\n    P0 — must confirm MaxSAT mechanism is not vacuous.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: SICA +0.26pp at N=762, no significant gain\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-013\\\\n    role: upgraded_P0\\\\n    result: Must confirm aggregation mechanism\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-010\\\\n    role: reframed\\\\n    result: Cross-family validation of negative result\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011\\\\n    role: reframed\\\\n    result: Cross-family validation of negative result\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 19:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-001 完成确认 D025 pivot：SICA≈SC (+0.25pp, n=804, n.s.)，FOLIO sub-claim\\\\n    dead (0.00pp)\\\\n  rationale: 804题全量评估确认：SICA vs SC gap仅+0.25pp（2题净差异），远低于显著性阈值。FOLIO 204题 gap=0.00pp，D012的+6.7pp确认为小样本噪声。数据坚实支持D025\\\\n    Analysis Paper pivot方向。FOLIO sub-claim正式放弃。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: +0.25pp overall (n.s.), FOLIO 0.00pp\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-16 20:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-013 确认 MaxSAT≈count-only≈random-weight：SICA 的 aggregation mechanism\\\\n    无贡献 (C1 confirmed)\\\\n  rationale: 804题上三种 constraint aggregation 方法（MaxSAT/count-only/random-weight）802/804\\\\n    结果一致，McNemar p>0.7。MaxSAT 优化相对简单计数零优势，直接支持 Capability Trap 论文 C1：\\\\\\\"mechanism is\\\\n    vacuous when constraint quality is bounded by LLM capability\\\\\\\"。近似公式限制可接受（802/804\\\\n    agreement rate 压倒性）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-013\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: MaxSAT=76.49%, count-only=76.62%, random=76.37%, SC=76.24%, all n.s.\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: data source\\\\n    result: +0.25pp baseline\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D026\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 01:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-002 中期：K=11 gap=0 确认 tiebreak-only；D012 vs K-ablation K=12 swing 8.33pp\\\\n    证明 n=60 结果为噪声\\\\n  rationale: K=11 (odd, no ties) SICA=SC 精确相等，证实 SICA 从不 override 清晰多数。更关键：同数据同设置\\\\n    K=12 两次实验结果相反（D012 +3.33pp vs K-ablation -5.00pp），8.33pp swing 直接证明小样本 gap 完全被\\\\n    trace 随机性淹没。FOLIO 上 SICA 恒定 76.67% 而 SC 随 K 提升——constraint quality 天花板限制了 SICA\\\\n    利用更多 traces 的能力。考虑升级 claim：从\\\\\\\"SICA≈SC\\\\\\\"到\\\\\\\"SICA≤SC at scale\\\\\\\"（更多 traces 帮 SC 但被 SICA\\\\n    constraint ceiling 限制）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: K=11 gap=0, K=12 gap=-5pp, FOLIO SICA ceiling effect\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: +0.25pp at K=12 n=804\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D027\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 02:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-002 最终结果：SICA≤SC for all K (gap 0 to -5pp)，framing 维持\\\\\\\"SICA≈SC (mechanism\\\\n    vacuous)\\\\\\\"不升级为\\\\\\\"SICA&lt;SC\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: K-ablation 6个K值全部 SICA≤SC，但 n=60 方差大（D012 vs K-ablation swing 8.33pp）。exp-001\\\\n    n=804 显示 +0.25pp (n.s.)。安全 framing 是\\\\\\\"gap indistinguishable from zero + mechanism\\\\n    introduces noise\\\\\\\"，而非\\\\\\\"SICA systematically worse\\\\\\\"。FOLIO 恒定 76.67% 是 constraint quality\\\\n    ceiling 的可视化证据。K=11 odd-K 确认 tiebreak-only。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: SICA≤SC all K; K=11 gap=0; FOLIO ceiling 76.67%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: anchor\\\\n    result: +0.25pp n=804 n.s.\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 04:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D030: 从 Analysis Paper 转向 Methods Paper — 利用诊断数据设计 Constraint Consistency\\\\n    Filtering 改进 SICA'\\\\n  rationale: '用户明确指示 methods paper 质量更高且更受欢迎。现有分析数据（exp-001/002/013/016）不浪费——变成论文动机和诊断部分。核心\\\\n    method idea: constraint consistency filtering（只保留跨多条 traces 重复出现的约束），利用已有 diversity\\\\n    提升 constraint quality 而不需更强模型。时间和资源充足（用户确认），pilot 可在当天 CPU-only 完成（如数据可用）。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: data source for pilot\\\\n    result: 804题 K=12 traces\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-013\\\\n    role: diagnosis\\\\n    result: MaxSAT≈count-only confirmed quality is bottleneck\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 08:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D031: exp-011 +6.7pp 方向性正面但 p=0.22 不显著，启动 LLaMA-8B StrategyQA 200 题 powered\\\\n    test 验证 operating regime 假设'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-011 LLaMA-8B 在 D012 60 题上 SICA +6.67pp (McNemar p=0.22, 6 discordant\\\\n    pairs 5:1)。n=60 检验力不足，无法排除噪声。但跨模型 pattern 清晰（弱→强: +6.7pp → +0.3pp → -1.7pp → 0pp），值得\\\\n    powered verification。StrategyQA 200 题 + LLaMA-8B 预期 multi-candidate rate 高（弱模型+commonsense\\\\n    推理），n=200 可检测 5pp 差异 (power>0.8)。若 p<0.05 → paper 升级为 Operating Regime Characterization；若\\\\n    p>0.1 → 维持 D025 Capability Trap analysis paper，LLaMA 作为 suggestive evidence。不在\\\\n    powered test 前更新 paper_framing.md。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011-llama8b-v3\\\\n    role: 触发\\\\n    result: +6.67pp, p=0.22, directionally positive\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-010-mistral-v3\\\\n    role: 并行验证\\\\n    result: running, 9/60 done\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: 对照\\\\n    result: Qwen-14B +0.25pp n.s.\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 08:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D032: exp-010 Mistral 确认倒 U 型 pattern（sweet spot SC~55-65%），FOLIO 204\\\\n    升为最高优先级 powered test'\\\\n  rationale: Mistral-7B SICA≡SC (0.0pp, SC=48.3%, zero discordant)。与 LLaMA-8B (+6.7pp,\\\\n    SC=60%) 和 Qwen-14B (+0.25pp, SC=76%) 合看，pattern 是倒 U 型而非单调递减。Sweet spot 在 SC~55-65%：模型够弱产生多样性，但够强保证约束质量。LLaMA-8B\\\\n    在 FOLIO 上恰好在 sweet spot（SC=60%, +10pp at n=30），几乎必然在 n=200 时显著。StrategyQA 上 LLaMA-8B\\\\n    的 SC 未知，可能落在 sweet spot 外（类似 Mistral）。因此 FOLIO 204 是确定性更高的 powered test 选择。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-010-mistral-v3\\\\n    role: 触发\\\\n    result: SICA=SC=48.3%, 0.0pp, zero discordant\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011-llama8b-v3\\\\n    role: sweet spot 证据\\\\n    result: +6.67pp at SC=60%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: 对照\\\\n    result: +0.25pp at SC=76%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 09:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D033: exp-019 StrategyQA +2pp n.s. 确认 inverted U — operating regime 取决于\\\\n    model×task accuracy band (SC~55-65%)，非模型强弱'\\\\n  rationale: 'LLaMA-8B StrategyQA: SC=72%, SICA +2.0pp (net 4题, p>0.1 几乎确定)。LLaMA-8B\\\\n    在 commonsense 上不弱(72%)，只在 logic 上弱(60%)。这证明 operating regime 是 model×task specific，不是\\\\n    model-level property。5 个数据点画出完整曲线：SC=48%(0pp) → 60%(+6.7pp) → 72%(+2pp) → 76%(+0.3pp)\\\\n    → 97%(-1.7pp)。Sweet spot 在 SC~55-65%。D031 的 p<0.05 门槛未达，但 exp-020 FOLIO 204 (LLaMA-8B\\\\n    × FOLIO, SC=60% in sweet spot, +10pp signal) 仍是 definitive test。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-019-llama8b-strategyqa-200\\\\n    role: 触发\\\\n    result: +2.0pp, SC=72%, p>0.1\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011-llama8b-v3\\\\n    role: sweet spot 参照\\\\n    result: +6.67pp, SC=60%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-010-mistral-v3\\\\n    role: 下界\\\\n    result: 0pp, SC=48%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D032\\\\n  - D031\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 10:04 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D034: exp-020 同题对比证伪 operating regime 假设——exp-011 +10pp 不可复现（同题反转 -3.3pp），D025\\\\n    Capability Trap 为最终论文方向'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-020 FOLIO 204 中间数据（n=78）: SICA -2.94pp（SC 领先）。同题 30 FOLIO 对比：exp-011\\\\n    +10pp → exp-020 -3.3pp，delta 完全反转。SICA agreement 仅 56.7%，说明 K=12 n=30 方差极大，exp-011\\\\n    +6.67pp 是随机波动非真实信号。结合 exp-019 StrategyQA +2pp (p=0.424)，SICA 在任何 model×task regime\\\\n    下都不优于 SC。D025 Capability Trap analysis paper 是唯一合理方向。下一步：等 exp-020 全 204 题完成做最终录入，然后进入论文写作。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-020-llama8b-folio-204\\\\n    role: definitive test\\\\n    result: n=78 intermediate -2.94pp; 同题30 FOLIO 反转 -3.3pp\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011-llama8b-v3\\\\n    role: 被证伪\\\\n    result: +6.67pp 确认为 sampling noise\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-019-llama8b-strategyqa-200\\\\n    role: 佐证\\\\n    result: +2pp p=0.424\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D033\\\\n  - D032\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 11:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D035: exp-020 FOLIO 204 确认 SICA≤SC (-2.4pp)，Operating Regime 彻底死亡，D025\\\\n    Capability Trap 为最终论文方向，进入写作阶段'\\\\n  rationale: exp-020 LLaMA-8B FOLIO 全量 204 题：SICA 60.8% vs SC 63.2%，delta=-2.4pp，方向反转。exp-011\\\\n    的 +10pp 是 n=30 小样本噪声（SE≈9pp）。四个 powered test 无一支持 SICA 优势（exp-001 +0.25pp n.s.,\\\\n    exp-019 +2.0pp p=0.424, exp-020 -2.4pp, exp-010 0.0pp）。D031 全部条件触发\\\\\\\"维持 D025\\\\\\\"路径。不再需要更多\\\\n    powered tests，进入 CPU ablations + 论文写作。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-020-llama8b-folio-204\\\\n    role: definitive_test\\\\n    result: 'negative: -2.4pp, SICA worse than SC'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-019-llama8b-strategyqa-200\\\\n    role: powered_test\\\\n    result: 'negative: +2.0pp p=0.424'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-011-llama8b-v3\\\\n    role: refuted\\\\n    result: +10pp was n=30 noise\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: anchor\\\\n    result: +0.25pp n.s. on 804q\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D034\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-17 11:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D036: Manager 要求实验覆盖自查——补 temperature ablation (T=0.3/0.5/1.0) + GSM8K\\\\n    pilot + Qwen-7B scaling + Mistral StrategyQA，总计 ~10h GPU'\\\\n  rationale: 自查发现两个 Critical 缺口：(1) Temperature ablation 直接检验 capability trap 核心机制（diversity↑但\\\\n    quality↓→SICA 仍无效），审稿人必问，~3h GPU；(2) GSM8K 数学域缺失，LLM reasoning 最标准 benchmark，~1h\\\\n    GPU。Important 缺口：Qwen-7B 补 scaling curve（C0 gradient claim），Mistral 跨域（消除 model-specific\\\\n    质疑）。所有补充实验总计 ~10h GPU，1 天内可完成，不影响 ARR May 25 写作排期。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: temperature-ablation\\\\n    role: new_critical\\\\n    result: 'planned: T=0.3/0.5/1.0 on Qwen-14B D012'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-012\\\\n    role: new_critical\\\\n    result: 'planned: GSM8K 30q pilot'\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: new_important\\\\n    result: 'planned: Qwen-7B scaling'\\\\n  - exp_id: mistral-strategyqa\\\\n    role: new_important\\\\n    result: 'planned: Mistral-7B StrategyQA 60q'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 26451, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_