{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018weMVqorbrFsbkUg35n9vP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# symb_invariant_consensus — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-17 15:48 UTC | 更新原因: 标记已完成 CPU tasks + 更新 D036 进展\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n**D025 Capability Trap Analysis Paper (FINAL)**：SICA ≈ SC everywhere。Constraints lack discriminative power regardless of diversity level. 详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research → Writing transition（D035/D036 确认最终方向 + 补充实验）\\\\n- **关键结论**:\\\\n  - 五个模型全部 negative: Qwen-14B +0.25pp, Mistral-7B 0pp, LLaMA-8B -2.4pp/+2.0pp, DeepSeek-R1-7B -3.3pp\\\\n  - exp-013: MaxSAT ≈ count-only（mechanism vacuous）\\\\n  - exp-015: Logic-LM baseline 无优势（62.7% vs SC 63.2%）\\\\n  - exp-009: SICA +48.7% overhead，全来自 LLM extraction\\\\n  - F2 per-problem 数据就绪（n=307, vote_entropy ρ=0.36）\\\\n  - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 重分类为 instruction-scale（C0=58%，非 reasoning model）\\\\n- **已完成实验**: 12 个 success + 6 个 informative negative\\\\n- **D036 补充实验**: temperature ablation 运行中，GSM8K/Qwen-7B/Mistral-StrategyQA 脚本就绪\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] exp-009: overhead analysis（CPU，+48.7% wall time）\\\\n- [x] exp-015: Logic-LM baseline（CPU，无优势）\\\\n- [x] exp-016: weighted SC baseline（CPU，all n.s.）\\\\n- [x] constraint quality correlation + F2 per-problem CSV（CPU，n=307）\\\\n- [x] exp-014 DeepSeek-R1 完成（negative，C0=58%，reclassified）\\\\n- [x] registry 数据修复（C0 定义统一 + extraction_rate bug + notes）\\\\n- [ ] **temperature ablation T=0.3/0.5/1.0**（GPU 运行中，~2h remaining）\\\\n- [ ] exp-012 GSM8K pilot（GPU，temperature 后）\\\\n- [ ] exp-004 Qwen-7B scaling（GPU，symlink 已修复）\\\\n- [ ] Mistral-7B StrategyQA（GPU，脚本就绪）\\\\n- [ ] dream_simulate 结果处理（reviewing 阶段，即将完成）\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent 启动写作（dream 后）\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 1× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 98GB (cuda:0) on westd-32608\\\\n- 当前: temperature ablation 运行中（T=0.3→0.5→1.0 串行）\\\\n- 排队: GSM8K ~1h → Qwen-7B ~2h → Mistral-StrategyQA ~1.5h\\\\n- 累计已用: ~26h\\\\n\\\\n## 阻塞项\\\\n- 无硬阻塞。Dream reviewing 中（~10min），temperature ablation ~2h remaining。\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-17 | D036: Manager 要求实验覆盖自查——补 temperature ablation (T= | temperature-ablation, exp-012, exp-004, mistral-strategyqa |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-17 | D035: exp-020 FOLIO 204 确认 SICA≤SC (-2.4pp)，Operat | exp-020-llama8b-folio-204, exp-019-llama8b-strategyqa-200, exp-011-llama8b-v3, exp-001 |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-17 | D034: exp-020 同题对比证伪 operating regime 假设——exp-011  | exp-020-llama8b-folio-204, exp-011-llama8b-v3, exp-019-llama8b-strategyqa-200 |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-17 | D033: exp-019 StrategyQA +2pp n.s. 确认 inverted U — | exp-019-llama8b-strategyqa-200, exp-011-llama8b-v3, exp-010-mistral-v3 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-17 | D032: exp-010 Mistral 确认倒 U 型 pattern（sweet spot S | exp-010-mistral-v3, exp-011-llama8b-v3, exp-001 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-17 | D031: exp-011 +6.7pp 方向性正面但 p=0.22 不显著，启动 LLaMA-8B | exp-011-llama8b-v3, exp-010-mistral-v3, exp-001 |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-17 | D030: 从 Analysis Paper 转向 Methods Paper — 利用诊断数据设计 | exp-001, exp-013 |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-17 | exp-002 最终结果：SICA≤SC for all K (gap 0 to -5pp)，fra | exp-002, exp-001 |\\\\n| D028 | 2026-05-17 | exp-002 中期：K=11 gap=0 确认 tiebreak-only；D012 vs K-a | exp-002, exp-001 |\\\\n| D027 | 2026-05-16 | exp-013 确认 MaxSAT≈count-only≈random-weight：SICA 的  | exp-013, exp-001 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3075, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01G9MVyWtxFyXSAAjr8MLYHk","session_id":"c45da324-b22a-497d-aa29-83b1dc828269","uuid":"0e7c0576-6390-4a54-b589-6a5f9c7861e4","timestamp":"2026-05-17T15:59:45.394Z"}
