{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014s1oMLP7eDRzG7yjDpaq6K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Review submitted. **Consensus: 3/6 (Weak Reject), Confidence 4/5.**\n\nTop-level findings from the roundtable:\n\n- **Strongest asset:** The constraint ablation (MAX-SAT ≈ count-only ≈ random-weight, 802/804 agreement) and per-problem precision analysis are genuinely publishable-quality empirical work.\n- **Three critical weaknesses both reviewers converged on:** (1) claims generalize to \"symbolic consensus\" but only one pipeline is tested, while published methods (DyLoS, Aristotle, FoVer) achieve gains on the same benchmarks; (2) self-extraction confound (same model generates and extracts) is unaddressed; (3) only 8 references, critically below the 30-50 expected.\n- **Path forward:** Narrow claims to match evidence, expand bibliography, add gold-FOL oracle / stronger-extractor controls, render missing figures."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4058,"cache_read_input_tokens":67171,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4058},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c45da324-b22a-497d-aa29-83b1dc828269","uuid":"0022f512-6fbd-40bf-8198-2af7fef82b98"}
